# Split Payment — Full Implementation Plan (v2, all gaps fixed)

## Overview

Implement a two-payment split system (Hybrid Model) across the full stack as a **purely additive** change. All existing flows (full-payment instant, enquiry, cancellation, dashboard) are preserved.

> All new fields are nullable with defaults. `is_split_payment=False` on all existing bookings means every existing code path is bypassed automatically.

