## Step 2 — Split Payment Service

### NEW: split_payment_service.py

- `calculate_split_amounts(total, type, value)` -> (advance, final)
- `calculate_final_payment_due_date(travel_date, booking_date, direction, days)` -> date
- `should_bypass_split(travel_date, booking_date, package)` -> (bool, reason)
- `enable_final_payment(booking_id, triggered_by, triggered_by_name, db)` -> link_url
  - Creates Razorpay Payment Link for final_amount
  - Sets BookingPayment(FINAL).razorpay_link_id, link_sent_at, triggered_by, triggered_by_name
  - Transitions booking.final_payment_status: LOCKED -> PENDING (or PENDING stays for date_wise)
  - Sends final_payment_link_email to customer

